            "searchField": "select.adjascentfaces tristan-huber selects faces adjacent to the existing selection. already selected faces are specifically excluded even if they share an edge with another selected face. abundance-tool",
            "owner": "tristan-huber",
            "description": "Selects faces adjacent to the existing selection. Already selected faces are specifically excluded even if they share an edge with another selected face.",
